&lt;h2 id="garden-description"&gt;Garden Description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The garden (a) and cistern that was in the southwest corner of this house had been paved over by CE 79. There was a &lt;em&gt;puteal&lt;/em&gt; in the courtyard.&lt;/p&gt;
